    'M7 2h10a5 5 0 0 1 5 5v10a5 5 0 0 1-5 5H7a5 5 0 0 1-5-5V7a5 5 0 0 1 5-5Z|M16 11.37A4 4 0 1 1 12.63 8 4 4 0 0 1 16 11.37Z|M17.5 6.5h.01',
